[THINKING]● Thinking: **Analyzing tenant caching issues with tests**

I’m figuring out why tests fail with tenant resolution problems—most likely because the tenant cache retains stale entries between tests, causing mismatched tenant IDs and thus 403 errors. Clearing the tenant cache before each test setup should fix this and ensure fresh data is read. I plan to inject the CacheManager in headless tests and clear the "tenant-cache" at setup to resolve these failures.
